{"id":2089,"level":80,"name":"Відкритий напад (3)","group":"Відкритий напад","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>The discovered attack remains one of the most powerful weapons in chess. By moving a piece and revealing an attack, you create a situation where multiple opposing pieces come under pressure. A discovered attack is particularly effective because you essentially set up two threats simultaneously. As the front piece moves, it opens the attack of a rook, queen, or bishop behind it.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":103,"examples":[{"fen":"r5k1/pR3pb1/1n2q1p1/2p1P3/7p/5Q2/P1P2PP1/4R2K w - - 0 23","pgn":"23. Rxb6 {[%csl Ra8,Gb6,Re6,Gf3][%cal Gf3a8,Gb6e6]} Qxb6 24. Qxa8+ * ","text":"<p>Білі жертвують тут туру, відкриваючи атаку на туру супротивника. У результаті білі отримують коня в шахах.</p><p><br></p>","format":27},{"fen":"r3k2r/pp1n1ppp/4pn2/3p4/1q1N1Q2/2N1P3/PPP2PPP/R4RK1 w kq - 0 13","pgn":"13. Nxe6 {[%csl Rb4,Ge6,Gf4,Rf7][%cal Ge6f4]} Qxf4 14. Nxf4 * ","text":"<p>Білі беруть пішака e6, також захищаючи ферзя. Після розміну ферзями білі залишаються пішаком, оскільки кінь може повернутися до сильної позиції.</p><p><br></p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77751,"fen":"2kr3r/2p2p2/bp1p3n/pN1Pp3/P3P1Nq/3Q1P2/1PP3P1/R4RK1 w - - 0 21","pgn":"{[%csl Ra6][%evp 0,3,135,171,152,145]} {Q=1} 21. Nxd6+ Rxd6 {Q=2} 22. Qxa6+ * ","format":27,"texts":["Вільні фігури пропонують тактичні можливості.","Вільні фігури пропонують тактичні можливості."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77761,"fen":"r1bq1rk1/pppp1pp1/2n2b1p/4p3/2P5/3P1NP1/PP2PPBP/RN1Q1RK1 b - - 0 9","pgn":"{[%csl Gf6][%evp 0,5,-152,-145,-151,-162,-162,-162]} {Q=1} 9... e4 10. dxe4 {Q=2} Bxb2 11. Nbd2 {Q=3} Bxa1 * ","format":27,"texts":["Look for weaknesses in White's camp.","Unguarded pawns and pieces are vulnerable.","Час заробляти!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77760,"fen":"r1bqk2r/pp2ppbp/6p1/3p4/3nn3/1P1B1N2/P4PPP/